  _konamiI=(e.code===_KONAMI[_konamiI])?_konamiI+1:(e.code===_KONAMI[0]?1:0);                                                               // a wrong verb resets; a wrong verb that is W restarts the incantation. NO preventDefault — the taps remain live play
